********************************************************************
1.ncycl, nsamp, nequil (production trial moves, sample every nsamp moves,
                        equilibration trial moves; 1 cycle = 1 trial move)
2.natoms
3.tref (T*)
4.sigma,epsil (LJ parameters in A and K)
5.deltax (initial max. displacement in sigma; tuned to 50% acceptance in equilibration)
6.rho* (target density; <= 0 keeps the density of leap-conf.data, ~0.835)
7.iseed (random number seed)
